{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_astesi_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_astesi_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"啟明","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_astesi_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"2b40bf470b504c50ce4b19bf0524ca6d9379b7cc4fb06e7c519d61dfc10a2a83","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"羅德島本艦\n星極的房間"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（揉眼睛）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我沒記錯的話......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"根據書上的記載，今晚星象會很穩定，星體也很明顯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但願今晚能有所收獲......吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不經意地揉眼睛）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"近期的星象測算結果和占星研究協會公佈的數據相差太多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"父親他......一定對這件事很不滿意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"給父親的回信還是再緩一段時間比較穩妥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"礦石病......礦石病......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不經意地揉眼角）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今晚多做些記錄吧。如果推測還是有問題，就只能先觀測一份正確的數據了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（輕輕按了按眼角）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"眼睛好癢......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐，我來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，早上——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐，你眼睛怎麼了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"眼睛嗎？只是有些癢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"眼睛裡全是血絲，怎麼還有血點？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很快就會好的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"眼瞼裡還有腫塊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人的自瘉能力可不包括修復這種損傷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我現在就帶你去醫療部。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，今天晚上——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就別管星星不星星的了。它們就算掉下來也不能治好你的眼睛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等，等等......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ri_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"細菌感染，雙眼急性化膿性炎症。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"不是特別嚴重，現在安排手術切除後上藥，很快就能康復。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"手術後三十六小時不能視物，保險起見最好在醫療部留觀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"手術，可以延遲嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"醫生，這件事我拿主意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"家屬和患者先得出一個結論吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吉妮......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這件事沒得商量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我瞭解你的理由，也明白這對你來說很重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我還是要重申一遍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這件事沒得商量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道我更關心什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我姐姐同意了，麻煩安排手術吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"星極幹員，我需要你的口頭確認。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"家屬先在這份告知書上簽字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（閱覽並簽署告知書）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"（接過告知書，在終端上輸入資訊）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"去前台協調床位，一會結束手術後病患會直接被送到病房，家屬在那裡等待即可。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"星極幹員，請跟我來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_infirmary"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"手術本身沒有什麼難度，請放輕鬆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"根據手術前交流，我們會為你準備全身麻醉，沒有問題吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（點頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"（注射麻醉藥物）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"現在請從一數到十。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"不知過了多久"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......說話嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"聽到的話請動一下手指。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小拇指顫動）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"患者甦醒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"手術很成功，星極幹員。一會護士們會把你送到指定病房，晚上我會巡診。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"如果有任何不適記得第一時間通知我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"聽到的話請點頭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（費勁地點了點頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"很好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"醫生的腳步聲逐漸遠去，病床被放平，隨後推上了走廊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"narration","text":"輪子與地面接觸，不斷發出刺耳的聲響。\n但比那更嘈雜的，是醫療部內醫生、病患與隨行者們的抱怨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"再忍一下，泡普卡，馬上就到你了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，今天怎麼那麼多人生病啊！下一個是誰？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不是繳完費了嗎？怎麼還要簽協議？行行行，趕緊拿出來。我姐姐還在病床上等我呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我也不知道我會對這個美甲油過敏啊......好癢......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"人聲帶著不自知的情感從四面八方傳來。\n沮喪、懊悔、畏懼，星極聽得很清楚。\n她心中揚起了些許不安。\n如果在平日裡，她或許能給這些受苦的人帶去點安慰。\n可現在呢，她自己也是癱倒床頭的病患。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"病床在走廊上緩緩停下，調整方向，進入一間病房。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"醫療幹員們俐落地將病床固定好，為病患講解了一些病房須知。\n再次確認病患無恙後，他們匆匆離去。\n病房門被關上，醫療部的吵鬧聲瞬間離開了星極的腦袋。\n一片寂靜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吉妮......"},{"type":"narration","text":"隨著麻藥藥效褪去，她開口發聲，呼喚自己的妹妹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吉妮......你在嗎......"},{"type":"narration","text":"無人回應。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人嗎？"},{"type":"narration","text":"這片空間中，只有她的聲響。\n一股無力感湧上心頭。\n曾幾何時，她是個為眾人指引方向的星象學家。\n然而現在，她既不能為他人預示方向，也無法看清自己的前路。\n就從源石扎根於身體的那一刻開始......\n群星沉默不語。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她還記得，一些知名的占星術師並不避諱自己感染者的身份。\n她也還記得，父親對於自己感染的態度。\n“隱含著喜悅的關切”。\n所以當他發現自己的女兒沒能借助感染一躍成為更加優秀的占星術師，反而變得一事無成時，他毫不掩飾自己的失望。\n......\n或許，當自己躲在安全屋內擔驚受怕，看著妹妹獨自一人面對源石洩露的實驗室時，星辰就已不願眷顧這怯懦的人了。\n星空收起了垂憐，取而代之的，是源石的反光。\n閃閃發亮，刺痛人心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（輕聲）姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（輕聲）你還好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......吉妮？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我在呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"醫療部這裡辦暫住手續太麻煩了，為了給你找個安靜的單間和他們吵了好久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"單間......你又亂花錢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也沒有啦，只是稍微從設備費裡勻了一些出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？手上全是汗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不......沒事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"眼睛舒服點了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"已經不癢了，亞葉醫生處理得很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，你不是總喜歡叫我注意休息早睡早起，怎麼自己還搞成這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還在想今晚觀星的事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"今晚是這幾個月以來觀測條件最成熟的日子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要是敢把繃帶解下來我現在就去找醫生拿束縛帶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不會了，只是想想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"眼睛更重要，我聽你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......嗯，那就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算你看了，父親那裡也不會給你什麼好回應吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看了你這幾個月的觀測記錄和結論闡述，好像和協會的出入比較大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是在找你身份證件去辦手續的時候瞥到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"文件就放在桌上，也沒遮掩起來嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"自那以後我就再沒能給父親和協會提供正確的數據推斷，他會斥責我也是理所應當的事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實我根據你的數據結果推算了一遍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐你的結論一直都是對的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你不用安慰我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不是外行，對不對？雖說我真的不喜歡觀星，但無論如何我是接受過系統教育的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對就是對錯就是錯，在這一點上我沒有騙你的必要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等你眼睛好了我可以把所有流程和可能性用數據模型給你列個清單。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你是想說協會的數據出錯了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀父親是個石頭腦袋怎麼你也一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有沒有可能兩邊都沒有錯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這在研究領域還是很常見的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，一個數據總是會受到各種因素的影響，羅德島都不在哥倫比亞境內，觀測環境與地理位置完全不一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"加上星體運動本就不規律，數據與推論如果和哥倫比亞那裡一致反而有問題，對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可我已經根據方位調整過運算邏輯了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別激動姐姐，別激動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我才說你的數據也沒有錯誤嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小時候父親那套方法是我學得比較快，但要說給推論和結果，你可比我準多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也該明白父親不總是對的了。不要他們質疑你就覺得自己錯了，好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）雖然我也沒這個立場給別人說這種話......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳嗯，總之，等你病好了，我來幫你解決它，要是有必要的話......一起回家應付父親也不是不可以。怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"吉妮，讓我握握你的手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多大的人了，喏。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（輕輕握住妹妹的手）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是姐妹，有什麼好謝的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就先別想太多了，安心養病。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有什麼想吃的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"糖霜蛋糕——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"堅果餅乾加莓果汁，瞭解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"晚上就吃便當吧，來這以後還都是你下廚給我做東西吃，偶爾也嘗嘗我的手藝吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就先去準備了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（緩緩移動姐姐的手）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左手桌子上有切好的水果，每塊都插了牙籤，吃完直接把牙籤丟回盤子就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有這裡——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就在枕頭右邊，我把你的天球儀帶來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，應該沒什麼缺的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我先走了，自己小心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"隨著病房的門重新關閉，星極再度迎來了自己的獨處時光。\n眼前仍是一片黑暗，但這一次，有天球儀那穩定且柔緩的機械運作聲在耳邊徘徊，這段獨自承受黑暗的時光或許也沒有那麼難熬。\n來自妹妹的鼓勵幫助著她重新審視自己的問題。\n她是個獨立的人嗎？\n很慚愧地說，和星源比起來，她並不是。\n當自己的妹妹不斷突破束縛尋找自己所嚮往的生活時，她甚至沒有勇氣去反駁父親對於自己的質疑。\n星象學是個注重傳承的學科，雖然沒有現代科學那麼嚴謹，但足夠古老，而古老，就是誕生權威最好的土壤。\n她很早就意識到，自己的摸索與疑問會被老師們直接否決或給予既定答案。即使內心並不認同，她也會欣然接受。\n因為不存在錯誤，所以他們總是對的。\n她害怕被權威否定，因此對於他們的結論全盤接受。\n那麼，為什麼感染礦石病會打破這一壁障呢？\n是因為自己遇到了否定權威還是否定自我的兩難疑問？\n還是在見過妹妹挺身而出的壯舉後，自己也終於能夠鼓起勇氣直面自己一直以來的疑惑了？\n星極還沒能得出答案。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"除了去準備兩頓餐食，其他時間裡星源一直陪伴在星極身旁，有妹妹在一起消磨時間，病床上的生活倒也沒有那麼難過。\n夜幕降臨，星源原本想守在姐姐身邊，但星極想了想，還是把她勸回了宿舍。\n星極知道，此刻航行在荒野中的羅德島頭上，是一片璀璨的星空。\n她看過無數遍，仍舊癡迷於那潛藏其間的不確定性。如果可以的話，她想一直那麼注視下去，但是現在——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吉妮，還有事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我是來巡診的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"亞葉醫生，抱歉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"眼睛怎麼樣，有沒有瘙癢、流淚過度、發熱、異物感之類的問題？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有，您的手術很成功，醫生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"那眼睛的康復應該不成問題了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的聲音聽上去很疲憊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"習慣了，每一天都是這樣過的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果您沒有其他事的話，請在這休息一會吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然這麼說很慚愧，但我妹妹切了太多水果，一個人吃不完。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"就寢時間快到了，你是今天最後的病患。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以......在這裡待一刻鐘。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝您，醫生，我床旁應該有把椅子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"星源幹員選的水果都很健康。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不瞞您說，我們姐妹倆一直都喜歡吃這個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"其實，我有一個疑問，可能會冒犯到你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您說吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"我並沒有接觸過太多占卜、神秘學相關的幹員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"在我看來，他們總是會把自己包裝成一種全知全能的存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你們真的可以預知未來，為什麼會連自己的病痛都無法避免？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我從沒覺得自己是一個能夠知曉萬物的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只是我出生在一個星象學家庭，我從小學習的就是這些內容。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"當我想要去幫助他人的時候，所能運用的，也只有那些在您看來飄渺且無用的知識。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而且正如您所知道的那樣，無論是哥倫比亞的精英，還是拓荒隊中不識字的年輕人，他們都會遇見自己的閱歷無法解釋的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在那時候，他們會希望透過一種自己所不瞭解的神通來驅散迷茫。這就是我認知中，學習這門技藝的意圖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您也會有迷茫的時候，不是嗎，亞葉醫生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......你不會理解的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您知道嗎，今晚夜空中最明亮的星座代表著烏薩斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我確實無法理解您內心的痛苦，但透過非科學的手段，我還是可以知曉一些原委。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我無法寬慰您，對於您來說，那只是毫無意義的嘲弄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你能從醫的話，星極幹員，你絕對是一位心理學大師。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我就把這當作是資深醫師的誇獎了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟就算再頂尖的心理醫生，也不會知道自己哪一天會突然生眼疾的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"到那時候，還是得由您這樣腳踏實地掌握學識的人來治療。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"時間差不多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"好好休息，星極幹員，明晚我來巡診的時候，你就可以重見光明了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"醫生臨走之前為星極關上了檯燈，於是，星極一邊想像著今晚星空的模樣一邊沉沉睡去。\n正如自己的妹妹熱愛科學那樣，自己從小就對天空中的星星充滿感情。\n觀測星空於她而言不僅是先天的條件，同時也是後天的喜好。\n所以在被拒絕，被否定時，她的心中才會升起懊悔。\n不是因為被權威否決，而是受累於自己沒能瞭解一切的不甘。\n然而這般飄渺的知識，越是研究，越是能感受到自己的渺小。\n關於星空的疑問真的擁有答案嗎？\n星極無法回答。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"但有一點她很確定：\n當一個人在荒野的夜晚迷路時，他一定會仰望星空，看看天空中與之同行的閃爍群星，隨後繼續前行，直至走出困境。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"隨著陽光透過繃帶和眼瞼打在瞳孔上，星極從睡夢中醒來。\n她在等待自己的妹妹到來。\n這樣自己至少能在她的攙扶下去洗手間刷個牙，擦擦臉上沒有被繃帶覆蓋的地方，然後動動筋骨，再回到床上躺著。\n她所期待的開門聲響很快就傳入了耳中。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"然而，來的似乎不是星源。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"你還好嗎，星極姐姐？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特米米，你怎麼來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"今天和嘉維爾一起來的時候，她說昨天有一個經常和我一起聚會的人被送進病房了，我立刻就過來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"你還好嗎，看上去傷得很嚴重，是被誰打到眼睛流血了嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有那麼嚴重......只是感染了細菌，很快就能好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"話說回來，能幫我看看床頭有沒有牙刷杯子毛巾之類的東西嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"有的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（從床上起身）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那可能得麻煩你幫我拿一下——然後帶我去洗手間了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"沒問題！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"慢慢走......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"這是星極姐姐你的牙刷牙膏和杯子，需要我擠牙膏嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不用了，毛巾也放旁邊吧，我自己來就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（摸索著擠上牙膏開始刷牙）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"最近我把宿舍整理了一下，弄了幾個台座放東西，嘉維爾看到以後眼睛都發亮了，說我像是在供圖騰，看上去很有意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（含糊地應和）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"然後我前段時間在試著考那個護理能力資格之類的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"我雖然不太喜歡考試，但現在考過了，嘉維爾也允許我以後跟著她做些醫務工作了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（一邊刷牙一邊點頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"還有還有，柏喙小姐也願意教我怎麼做衣服了，等我學會了，我就可以給所有人做好看的衣服了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"星極姐姐，你怎麼不說話呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（吐出漱口水）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我聽著呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（洗毛巾）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你做得很好，特米米。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，多虧了星極姐姐給我出的點子，最近感覺多了許多想做的和能做的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"想做和能做的事嗎......哼哼~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（仔細擦拭臉龐）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，也是因為這些好事情聚在一起，反而碰上了一些麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（擰乾毛巾）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"能麻煩你先把我扶到床旁嗎？我們可以坐下來慢慢說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"星極姐姐當心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"注意腳下......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"坐吧，特米米。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經坐著了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那麼說說看，是怎麼樣的麻煩事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"是這樣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"因為要想怎麼照顧寶貝、要給嘉維爾幫忙、要去柏喙小姐那裡做衣服，還有其他事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"最近覺得時間有些不夠用了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以你是想......放棄什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"我確實是有考慮過，可能是自己喜歡的太多了，待在羅德島也有許多興趣以外必須要做的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"可能是，可以，把一些好玩的事延後的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"會不甘心吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"是這樣的，星極姐姐，就是這樣的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"但怎麼做才能都顧上，我也沒什麼頭緒......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"想要兼顧是人之常情，有些機會錯過了就不會回來，沒有什麼好自責的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你或許不太瞭解，在我們這裡，管理自己的時間也是門大學問。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我懂的也不多，但可以把我知道的都教給你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，謝謝星極姐姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"這也是占星術嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"占星？並不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"星星或許會指引道路，但在向著遠方前行這件事上，占星術是幫不上忙的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那需要自己的意志，以及千百倍的努力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不過我想，你是能做到的，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......嗯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"明天下午你會去書攤嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"會的，星極姐姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那我明天去找你吧，等你買好雜誌，我們慢慢聊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"去吧，嘉維爾這時候可能已經在抱怨助手不在身邊了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"是這樣嗎，我這就過去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你，星極姐姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不客氣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈啊......剛剛那是姐姐你的朋友嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"臉都洗完了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你應該看不見吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有人做我的眼睛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也是，明明只過了一天，來探視你的人都要在門口排隊了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星源","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，今天想吃點什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_0_rhodes3"},{"type":"narration","text":"......\n今晚的太陽已然落下，辛勞了一天的星源在姐姐身旁睡去。\n星極則在即將迎來光明的期待中，安然享受黑暗帶來的寧靜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"星......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"（輕聲）眼睛沒有異樣吧，星極幹員。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（輕聲）托您的福，醫生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"（輕聲）那我現在就幫你拆繃帶。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"醫生拿起工具，剪落星極眼睛的束縛。\n隨後拿起棉球，擦盡殘餘的藥膏。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"（輕聲）恭喜你，星極幹員，你康復了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"（輕聲）我把床燈調暗了，一會你眼睛適應之後可以開亮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"（輕聲）近期不建議飲酒、吃辛辣食品以及劇烈運動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"（輕聲）術後使用的滴眼液藥方之前我已經交給了你妹妹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（輕聲）謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"（輕聲）......過兩天，周末休假的時候，如果有時間，我想和你聊一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"（輕聲）......我可能需要一個心理醫生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星極","speakerId":"avg_274_Astesia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（輕聲）隨時歡迎，晚安，亞葉醫生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"（輕聲）晚安。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"醫生離開後，星極緩緩睜開了眼睛。她看到自己的妹妹累倒在床邊，而床旁放著自己用以記錄星象的記事本。\n她翻開本子，在最新的幾頁，星源用與自己相仿的字體記錄了昨晚夜空中群星的各項細節。\n一些記錄方式是錯誤的，一些星體的名字明顯也有問題。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"但那有什麼關係呢？\n星極闔上記事本，抬頭望向窗外的夜空。\n今天夜空中看不到星星，連月亮也被烏雲籠罩，發不出一絲光芒。\n然而她眼中的神采，此刻正如群星一般——\n閃閃發光。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_345_folnic","aliases":["亞葉"]},{"speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","aliases":["？？？","特米米"]}]}
